      "text": "When I lived back with my friend we used to hang out every day. Now we are separated and it feels like I am alone once again. I have been questioning whether to even talk to him. My mental state has deteriorated and I wonder if I’ll even be the same way I used to be with him. We used to get great joy out of each others company… but now it feels as though we both can’t bring ourselves to talk anymore. I wish HE was happy…",
